    {
      "id": "s2",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "In the light of this statement, teachers live by selling knowledge, philosophers by selling wisdom and priests by selling spiritual comfort.",
      "translation": "根据这种说法，教师靠卖知识为生，哲学家靠卖智慧为生，教士靠卖精神慰藉为生。",
      "startTime": 21.3,
      "endTime": 31.96,
      "analysis": {
