    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "Though it may be possible to measure the value of material goods in terms of money, it is extremely difficult to estimate the true value of the services which people perform for us.",
      "translation": "虽然物质产品的价值可以用金钱来衡量，但要估计他人为我们所提供服务的真价值却是极其困难的。",
      "startTime": 31.97,
      "endTime": 46.56,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "measure",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "衡量"
          },
          {
            "word": "estimate",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "估计"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "There are times when we would willingly give everything we possess to save our lives, yet we might grudge paying a surgeon a high fee for offering us precisely this service.",
      "translation": "有时，为了挽救生命，我们愿意付出我们拥有的一切；然而，要我们付给外科医生一笔高额手术费，我们却可能感到不情愿，尽管他所提供的正是这种服务。",
      "startTime": 46.57,
      "endTime": 60.35,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "willingly",
            "pos": "adv.",
            "meaning": "欣然地"
          },
          {
