    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "He may never be sure where the next meal is coming from, but he is free from the thousands of anxieties which afflict other people.",
      "translation": "他可能永远不知道下一顿饭从哪里来，但他却摆脱了那些折磨他人的成千上万种忧虑。",
      "startTime": 109.15,
      "endTime": 119.98,
      "analysis": {
